  <name>Termoso</name>
  <summary>SSH, SFTP and terminal client with an encrypted vault</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Termoso keeps your hosts, keys and snippets in a vault that is encrypted on your device, syncs them to your own server or none at all, and gives you a fast terminal, SFTP with resume and folder sync, port forwarding, Mosh, Telnet and serial consoles.</p>
    <p>Teams get shared vaults with roles, SSO, audit and session recordings on a self-hosted server.</p>
  </description>
